射不同，唤起了柔和的沙丘地形。在右边，雪开始形成微弱的线性山脊，暗示了塑造它们的风的定向图案。除此之外，散落的结晶霜散发着场景，捕捉阳光以产生精致的火花。\n\n前景水扩大了镜子状的平静，展示了轻风产生的光滑波纹。浅冰块间歇性地出现在地平线附近，半透明的边缘暗示着较冷的深度上的脆弱层。水闪闪发光，虹彩微弱，反映了上面的蓝色和白色的梯度，几乎无缝地将天空和地形融合在一起。遥远的地平线暗示着微弱的云层开始柔化了场景的鲜明，增强了巨大而未触及的寒冷氛围。这种扩大的全景以纯粹，简约的风格捕捉了冰，雪和水的宁静相互作用。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 386, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 233, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 39}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "", "slot_index": 0, "links": [553, 554], "label": "", "type": "STRING"}], "size": [75, 26], "pos": [1918.7567138671875, -1834.707275390625], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "", "link": 555, "label": "", "type": "*"}], "flags": {}, "id": 298, "type": "Reroute", "properties": {"horizontal": false, "showOutputText": false}, "order": 33}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [387, 555], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [422.41461181640625, 282.9922180175781], "pos": [1290, -1620], "widgets_values": ["", "Continuing outward from the current scene, the pool area transitions into a wider, open expanse of manicured lawn bordered by more dense hedges, creating a secluded retreat. To the left, a small pavilion emerges from the greenery, featuring whitewashed columns and a terracotta roof that harmonizes with the sunny Mediterranean feel. Its shaded interior hosts cushioned seating and a low, stone-top coffee table, enhancing the leisure-focused environment. Beyond the lush hedges, the terrain slopes gently downward, revealing a distant view of rolling hills dotted with olive trees. On the right of the pool, a stone pathway curves along the perimeter, leading to another section with a built-in outdoor kitchen finished in natural stone and stainless steel appliances. Decorative planters brimming with vibrant flowers line the edges, adding